          <tr><td>Ads or signup</td><td class="band">Neither</td><td>Some carry ads or paywalls</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <div class="cta">
        <span class="kicker">Dial it in, copy it out</span>
        <h3>Try the free CSS Generator</h3>
        <p>Build box-shadows, gradients, flexbox, and grid layouts with live sliders and a real-time preview, then copy the CSS or Tailwind classes. No signup, in your browser.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="/developer-toolbox/css-generators/">Open the CSS Generator</a>
